#: ../../solid/crystal_structure_input.rst:103
msgid ""
"SPR-KKR, `User Guide (19 October 2023) "
"<https://sprkkr.org/?download_id=3257&sdm_process_download=1>`_. "
"入力仕様はファイル種別と版に依存する。"
msgstr ""
"SPR-KKR, `User Guide (19 October 2023) "
"<https://sprkkr.org/?download_id=3257&sdm_process_download=1>`_. The "
"input specifications depend on the file type and version."

